        "acc_description": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "icon_style": "description",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-desc.png",
            "content": "<p>Brisa is a non-electronic sensory habit device with replaceable aroma cores — the hand-tomouth ritual you know, minus the nicotine. Here's how it works: snap an aroma core into the device, twist the base to set your airflow — tighter or looser, however you like to draw. Then reach for it in the moment you'd normally reach for your old habit. Same size, same weight, same motion. No charging, no e-liquid, no buttons. Here's the honest part: Brisa doesn't do the work for you — there's nothing in it but food-grade aroma compounds. It's simply the thing your hand reaches for instead, and every time it does, that's a moment that went to Brisa and not to nicotine. What you build from there is yours <em>(same idea as reaching for water instead of a snack out of habit — the water's not magic, the swap is)</em>. No nicotine, no vapour, no smoke. </p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_ingredients": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "icon_style": "ingredients",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-ingred.png",
            "content": "<p>Each core is packed with food-grade aroma compounds — the same kind used in premium scent and sensory products for decades — layered with a real cooling compound that creates that crisp, cool sensation at the back of the throat. As you draw, air pulls through the core, activating the aroma and delivering flavour and throat feel instantly — the result of meticulous hours of R&D to nail the exact sensation you're chasing. No nicotine, no vapour, no smoke, no combustion — just the sensory hit. Each core lasts 2–3 days. </p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_subscription": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Subscription",
            "icon_style": "subscription",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-sub.png",
            "content": "<p>Never run out. The Monthly Better Box sends 12 cores every 4 weeks for $44/mo with free shipping — a fresh mix of our signature flavours (Mint Ice, Raspberry Lime, Cherry Pom) plus a free Cherry Pom pack in every box. It's optional and separate from your device — add it at checkout or start it anytime you're running low. You're in full control: skip, pause or cancel anytime, no lock-in, no minimum. </p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_shipping": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping, returns & guarantee",
            "icon_style": "shipping",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-ship.png",
            "content": "<p>Free shipping, dispatched in 1–2 business days. Try Brisa with total confidence — you're covered: <br/>• Not clicking? Email us in your first 30 days — free pack of cores + our Ritual Playbook, and we'll personally dial in your flavour and airflow until it lands. <br/>• Faulty or not as described? Replaced or refunded, always. <br/>• Changed your mind? Unopened kits, full refund within 30 days. </p><p><em>(Opened devices can't be returned for hygiene reasons — the standard for every aroma and mouth-contact product.) </em></p>"
          }
        }
      },
